                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Don't let Orblitz simplicity put you off - it's actually quite engaging and it shows potential to be a fun game - a bit like a mashup of Nibbles and Pong. But it would be nice if it had a little progression, starting with a slightly simpler scenario or variables and getting harder over time. It really is just pot luck a lot of the time as you are launched into the thick of it from the off. But with just a few tweaks so that it's not a \"return to main menu\" fest and MacDuff could consider this a nice little game concept well executed. For now, it's a bit relentless, but worth checking out. You might actually be good at it! I wasn't.\n\nReviewed in The Steaming Pile #2:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CLWOJK7M-uk",
